    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the executive law, in relation to establishing the commission\nof the deaf, deafblind and hard of hearing; to amend the social services law,\nin relation to requiring the commission of the deaf, deafblind, and hard of\nhearing to transmit complaints in matters affecting the deaf, deafblind, and\nhard of hearing communities to the vulnerable persons' central register; and\nto repeal section 559 of the executive law relating to the New York state\ninteragency coordinating council for services to persons who are deaf,\ndeaf-blind, or hard of hearing",
